media/
build/
out/
*.mp4
*.mov
*.wav
*.mp3
*.onnx
*.bin
__pycache__/
.venv/
*.egg-info/
# raw captures never go in git (no LFS); only the manifests
projects/*/footage/*
!projects/*/footage/manifest.yaml
!projects/*/footage/manifest.md
*.png
!docs/**/*.png
# Live2D: Cubism Core + sample models are fetched (sha256-pinned), never committed (no redistribution)
live2d/media/
live2d/node_modules/
*.moc3
*.zip
# reference studies: media, derived stills AND anything that embeds a reference's own dialogue (transcript.json, WATCH.md, watch.json)
# stay on the box (needed by `promo refs check`; regenerate with `promo refs add`); only the DOSSIER.md write-up is tracked
projects/*/reference/*/*
!projects/*/reference/*/DOSSIER.md
# projects live outside the repo by default-friendly: `promo config output ~/promo-projects` (or $PROMO_PROJECTS); anything under projects/ stays local
projects/
